# PDFs (syllabi, brochures, acts...) are not kept in git: together they made the repository
# too big for Hostinger to clone. They live on the server in gbu-storage/static under the
# same path as here (public/courses/x.pdf -> gbu-storage/static/courses/x.pdf), and
# public/static-files.php serves them at the usual address. Keep a local copy in public/
# for `npm run dev`; upload new or changed PDFs to the server.
public/**/*.pdf
public/**/*.PDF

